        "    # J_gamma^[k] = |det(d phi^[k] / d p)| at p = u_gamma^[k](t,x)",
        "    # the level-set encoding carries these Jacobian weights automatically;",
        "    # an amplitude encoding of u itself would have to inject them, and they are",
        "    # not known a priori",
