        label: "The clock-register linear system $\\mathcal{A}\\vec{x} = \\vec{b}$ (sections III and IV)",
        labelJa: "時刻レジスタの線形系 $\\mathcal{A}\\vec{x} = \\vec{b}$（第 III 節・第 IV 節）",
