        "    # --- solve the projected imaginary-time equation of motion ---------------",
        "    solve  sum_q A^R_k,q theta_dot_q = -C^R_k   for real theta_dot           (Eq. 42)",
        "        # McLachlan's principle, delta || (d/dtau + H - E_tau)|phi(theta(tau))> || = 0",
