        "#   - best rounding only (error < 2^-(m+1)): lower bound P(1/2) = 4/pi^2",
        "#   - accepting BOTH phi-tilde and phi-tilde + 2^-m (accuracy 2^-m):",
        "#     success P(delta) + P(1-delta), lower bound 8/pi^2, hence error",
