    // algorithm prints the subset. Bernstein, Jeffery, Lange and Meurer write it
    // at every stage — §2 Searches, of the warm-up, "If there is a collision
    // $\\Sigma(I_1) = s - \\Sigma(I_2)$, print out $I_1 \\cup I_2$ as a root of
